  "intro": "Introduction 4 If you’re planning a trip to Peru , one of the most common questions is: Is travel […]",
  "content_html": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"introduction\"> Introduction</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5e7bd4bb2d66bf54362944cc/1751651610172-PEM117OFJBTY6YNAII19/1%2Bdisembarque%2B1.jpeg\" alt=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5e7bd4bb2d66bf54362944cc/1751651610172-PEM117OFJBTY6YNAII19/1%2Bdisembarque%2B1.jpeg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.cdc.gov/yellow-book/media/images/2025/02/5.1-Travel-Insurance-Travel-Health-Insurance-and-Medical-Evacuation-Insurance.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.cdc.gov/yellow-book/media/images/2025/02/5.1-Travel-Insurance-Travel-Health-Insurance-and-Medical-Evacuation-Insurance.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://static.roafly.com/blog-covers/peru-airport-customs-rules.webp\" alt=\"https://static.roafly.com/blog-covers/peru-airport-customs-rules.webp\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">4</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you’re planning a trip to Peru , one of the most common questions is:<br> <strong>Is travel insurance mandatory?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The short answer is: <strong>No, it is not mandatory—but it is highly recommended.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this guide, you’ll learn everything you need to know to travel safely and avoid unexpected expenses </p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"is-travel-insurance-required-for-peru\"> Is Travel Insurance Required for Peru?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Currently, <strong>Peru does NOT require travel insurance</strong> to enter the country (for most nationalities).</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> However:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Some airlines may recommend it</li>\n\n\n\n<li>It is essential for adventure tours</li>\n\n\n\n<li>It may be required for specific programs or visas</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-is-travel-insurance-important\"> Why Is Travel Insurance Important?</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://ivhq.imgix.net/images/projects/peru-lima/volunteer-abroad-in-peru-ivhq-lima-medical-outreach.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress\" alt=\"https://ivhq.imgix.net/images/projects/peru-lima/volunteer-abroad-in-peru-ivhq-lima-medical-outreach.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://peruexpeditions.com/peruvian-mountain-rescue-team/photos/2.jpg\" alt=\"https://peruexpeditions.com/peruvian-mountain-rescue-team/photos/2.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://static.independent.co.uk/2022/10/07/15/lost%20baggage%5B58%5D.png\" alt=\"https://static.independent.co.uk/2022/10/07/15/lost%20baggage%5B58%5D.png\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">4</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Traveling without insurance can be very expensive </p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"covers-medical-expenses\"> Covers Medical Expenses</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Accidents</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Illnesses</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hospitalization</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"essential-for-adventure-activities\"> Essential for Adventure Activities</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In destinations like:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Machu Picchu</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Cusco</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Puerto Maldonado</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Risks are higher (altitude, jungle, trekking)</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"travel-issues\"> Travel Issues</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Trip cancellations</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Delays</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lost luggage</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"emergency-evacuation\"> Emergency Evacuation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Especially important in:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Mountains</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Amazon rainforest</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Costs can reach thousands of dollars without insurance</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"how-much-does-travel-insurance-for-peru-cost\"> How Much Does Travel Insurance for Peru Cost?</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li> <strong>$30 – $80 USD</strong> → short trips (1–2 weeks)</li>\n\n\n\n<li> <strong>$80 – $150 USD</strong> → more complete coverage</li>\n\n\n\n<li> <strong>$150+ USD</strong> → premium plans</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Price depends on:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Age</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Trip duration</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Coverage level</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"what-should-a-good-insurance-plan-include\"> What Should a Good Insurance Plan Include?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Minimum medical coverage ($30,000 USD or more)<br> Emergency evacuation<br> Trip cancellation<br> Lost baggage protection<br> Adventure sports coverage (if applicable)</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"when-is-travel-insurance-highly-recommended\"> When Is Travel Insurance Highly Recommended?</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Trekking (Inca Trail, Salkantay)</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Amazon trips</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Adventure sports</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Long-term travel</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"tips-before-buying-travel-insurance\"> Tips Before Buying Travel Insurance</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li> Compare different providers</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Read the policy details carefully</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Check exclusions</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Make sure your activities are covered</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"plan-your-trip-safely\"> Plan Your Trip Safely</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To fully enjoy your experience in Peru, it’s best to combine:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> A reliable travel insurance plan<br> A trusted tour operator</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> With agencies like <strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">GT Peru Travel</a></strong>, you can travel safely, with full support and professional organization throughout your journey.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Contact us: +51 947 831 392</strong><br> Plan your trip with local experts and experience Peru worry-free </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
